  "notes": [
    "**Poder** is completely irregular",
    "Present: stem change o→ue (except nosotros)",
    "Preterite: completely irregular stem \"pud-\"",
    "Imperfect: regular -ER pattern based on infinitive stem \"pod-\"",
    "Pretérito Perfecto: regular past participle **podido**",
    "Future: irregular stem \"podr-\" (not \"poder-\")",
    "Condicional: irregular stem \"podr-\" + conditional endings",
    "Always followed by an infinitive: *puedo nadar* (I can swim)",
    "Common usage: *¿Puedes ayudarme?* (Can you help me?), *No pude hacerlo* (I couldn't do it)",
    "Related noun: **el poder** (power)",
    "Expression: *puede ser* (maybe, it could be)"
  ],
